        "<html><head/><body><p>This determines whether to show/use <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Simple USB ID Presets</span> or <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Custom USB ID Settings.</span></p><p>This can be useful for users with either more than four OpenFIRE lightguns, or simply want to personalize each lightgun, but the <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Simple Presets</span> may be preferable to some.</p><p>All lightguns default to a <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">P1 Simple USB ID Preset.</span></p></body></html>": "<html><head/><body><p>This determines whether to show/use <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Simple USB ID Presets</span> or <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Custom USB ID Settings.</span></p><p>This can be useful for users with either more than four OpenFIRE lightguns, or simply want to personalize each lightgun, but the <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Simple Presets</span> may be preferable to some.</p><p>All lightguns default to a <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">P1 Simple USB ID Preset.</span></p></body></html>",
